      "why_read": "Read this to understand how rate-distortion optimization strategically repeats bit patterns in ASTC textures to drastically improve downstream LZ compression package sizes. It provides a clear, mechanistic explanation of how texture encoders balance visual error against asset distribution efficiency.",
